* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_blnd (reference/crafted.toml, 14 Nov 2026): refinery blending,
* the equations EQ(l)_BLND (eqblnd.mod L67-71) with their preparation (ppmain.mod L1228-1333),
* the blending terms of the commodity balance (eqcombal.mod L30-35, L75-80), of the peak
* equation (eqpeak.mod L78) and of the objective (coef_obj.mod L93-94, eqobjvar.mod L105-107).
* Added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0). No suite model has
* blending data.
* The blends (BLE), their streams (OPR) and their specifications (SPE):
* - TRAGSL (transport motor spirit, made in demo12 from GSL by FTE-TRAGSL) is blended in REG1
*   and REG2 from GSL, NAP, BIO and LPG. GSL is itself a blend in REG2 (from NAP and LPG), so
*   it is in BLE and in OPR (ppmain.mod L1303).
* - REG1 has no REFUNIT (default 1, energy: L1251, L1326-1331); REG2 has REFUNIT 2 (weight:
*   L1304-1305, L1318-1324).
* - The specifications of TRAGSL in REG1: OCT (type 2, =G=, unit by default 1), SUL (type 1,
*   =L=, unit 2), RVP (type 3, =E=, unit 3), DEN (type 4, non-binding, unit 1). BL_START is
*   2010, 2015, 2015 and 2020, so the blend exists from 2010 (L1254-1256) and every
*   specification has a row from 2010. LPG has a quality for OCT only; GSL meets RVP exactly
*   (a coefficient of zero); BIO has no quality for RVP.
* - REG2: TRAGSL with OCT (=G=) and SUL (=L=, unit 3), and DEN with the type 5, which has no
*   equation but makes BIO a stream of the blend; GSL with OCT (=G=, unit 2) from 2020.
* - BL_TYPE of KER, which is not in BLE: in BLE_SPE only (L1246).
* - Costs: BL_VAROMC, and BL_DELIVC on the input BL_INP (electricity per unit of blend).
* - BLE_INP (the inputs of a blend) is only declared by TIMES (ppmain.mod L1240; the lines that
*   filled it are comments). It is declared and filled here, under the run's $ONMULTI, so that
*   the terms on it are reached: the input in the balance (eqcombal.mod L78-80), in the peak
*   equation (eqpeak.mod L78) with PEAKDA_BL (given for 2020; default 1, ppmain.mod L1296).
* - ENV_BL: TRACO2 from blending, in 2005 (before the blend starts), 2020 and 2030 (no
*   interpolation).
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET BLE /
TRAGSL
GSL
/
SET OPR /
GSL
NAP
BIO
LPG
/
SET SPE /
OCT
SUL
RVP
DEN
/
SET BLE_INP(R,COM,COM) /
REG1.TRAGSL.ELC
/
PARAMETER
REFUNIT ' '/
REG2 2
/
PARAMETER
CONVERT ' '/
GSL.DENS 0.75
GSL.WCV 1.02
GSL.VCV 0.76
NAP.DENS 0.70
NAP.WCV 0.98
NAP.VCV 0.72
BIO.DENS 0.79
BIO.WCV 0.62
BIO.VCV 0.50
LPG.DENS 0.54
LPG.WCV 1.07
LPG.VCV 0.57
/
PARAMETER
BL_TYPE ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.OCT 2
REG1.TRAGSL.SUL 1
REG1.TRAGSL.RVP 3
REG1.TRAGSL.DEN 4
REG2.TRAGSL.OCT 2
REG2.TRAGSL.SUL 1
REG2.TRAGSL.DEN 5
REG2.GSL.OCT 2
REG1.KER.OCT 2
/
PARAMETER
BL_START ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.OCT 2010
REG1.TRAGSL.SUL 2015
REG1.TRAGSL.RVP 2015
REG1.TRAGSL.DEN 2020
REG2.GSL.OCT 2020
/
PARAMETER
BL_UNIT ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.SUL 2
REG1.TRAGSL.RVP 3
REG1.TRAGSL.DEN 1
REG2.TRAGSL.SUL 3
REG2.GSL.OCT 2
/
PARAMETER
BL_SPEC ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.OCT 91
REG1.TRAGSL.SUL 40
REG1.TRAGSL.RVP 60
REG1.TRAGSL.DEN 0.76
REG2.TRAGSL.OCT 93
REG2.TRAGSL.SUL 50
REG2.GSL.OCT 88
/
PARAMETER
BL_COM ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.GSL.OCT 95
REG1.TRAGSL.NAP.OCT 70
REG1.TRAGSL.BIO.OCT 110
REG1.TRAGSL.LPG.OCT 100
REG1.TRAGSL.GSL.SUL 30
REG1.TRAGSL.NAP.SUL 80
REG1.TRAGSL.BIO.SUL 1
REG1.TRAGSL.GSL.RVP 60
REG1.TRAGSL.NAP.RVP 80
REG1.TRAGSL.LPG.RVP 20
REG1.TRAGSL.GSL.DEN 0.75
REG1.TRAGSL.NAP.DEN 0.70
REG1.TRAGSL.BIO.DEN 0.79
REG2.TRAGSL.GSL.OCT 95
REG2.TRAGSL.NAP.OCT 70
REG2.TRAGSL.GSL.SUL 30
REG2.TRAGSL.NAP.SUL 80
REG2.TRAGSL.BIO.DEN 0.79
REG2.GSL.NAP.OCT 70
REG2.GSL.LPG.OCT 100
/
PARAMETER
BL_INP ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.ELC 0.02
/
PARAMETER
BL_VAROMC ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.MEuro05 0.05
REG2.GSL.MEuro05 0.02
/
PARAMETER
BL_DELIVC ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.ELC.MEuro05 1.5
/
PARAMETER
ENV_BL ' '/
REG1.TRACO2.TRAGSL.GSL.2005 0.5
REG1.TRACO2.TRAGSL.GSL.2020 0.5
REG1.TRACO2.TRAGSL.NAP.2020 0.4
REG1.TRACO2.TRAGSL.NAP.2030 0.3
REG2.TRACO2.GSL.LPG.2030 0.2
/
PARAMETER
PEAKDA_BL ' '/
REG1.TRAGSL.2020 0.8
/
